: 0.5pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">퇴사,</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">영구 입사 불가 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">등의 조치가 이루어짐 (관련규정 : 생활관운영규정 제17조, 생활관관생수칙 제4, 5조)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 21pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 19.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">- 징계에 의해 퇴사할 경우 생활관비 환불 없음/생활관 식사는 의무식/납부기간 내 납부하지 않으면 신청이 자동 취소됨</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 21pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 19.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">- 방학기간 입사시 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">성적 및 거주지 제한 없음, 신청하는 순서대로 선발</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 신청 및 등록</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-